OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FThousands of migrants entered Ceuta,
OL,7,FSpain's North African territory, from
OL,8,FMorocco on Thursday, prompting local
OL,9,Fofficials to call for military support
OL,10,Fto help manage the situation.
OL,12,FSpain's interior ministry said it
OL,13,Fwould ensure public safety and
OL,14,Fmaintain border security, but added
OL,15,Fthat the circumstances did not meet
OL,16,Fthe legal threshold for declaring a
OL,17,Fnational emergency.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
