OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,F"The situation is absolute chaos,"
OL,7,Fsaid Rachid Sbihi, head of the
OL,8,Fassociation that represents Spain's
OL,9,FCivil Guard officers in Ceuta, who
OL,10,Fpolice the border.
OL,12,F"It's not possible to give precise
OL,13,Fnumbers, but there are thousands of
OL,14,Fmigrants crossing," he said, adding
OL,15,Fthat the border had "totally
OL,16,Fcollapsed".
OL,18,FThousands of migrants have entered
OL,19,FCeuta in recent days, overwhelming
OL,20,Fsecurity personnel
OL,26,@tD@AOUvD@SO]wD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FAchraf Maimouni, a member of the
OL,7,FMoroccan Association for Human Rights
OL,8,Fin northern Morocco, described the
OL,9,Fsituation as "exceptional".
OL,11,F"The Tarajal border was opened under
OL,12,Funusual circumstances this morning,
OL,13,Fand people crossed,'' he said.
OL,15,FVideo footage showed crowds of people,
OL,16,Fmainly Moroccans, walking around the
OL,17,Fbreakwaters at Tarajal beach onto
OL,18,Flocal roads.
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FWhile the majority appeared to be
OL,7,Fyoung men, there were also families
OL,8,Fwith women and children. "Viva
OL,9,FEspana!" some shouted.
OL,11,FThe escalation at the frontier between
OL,12,FSpain and Morocco comes after a surge
OL,13,Fin migrants attempting to reach the
OL,14,Fsmall exclave, mainly by swimming, on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FIt was not immediately clear what
OL,18,Fprompted so many migrants to cross to
OL,19,FCeuta.
OL,26,@pD@ZOUqD@ETwqD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FAt least three people died attempting
OL,7,Fto reach Ceuta by sea, Sbihi and
OL,8,Factivists in both Morocco and Ceuta
OL,9,Freported.
OL,11,FMoroccan authorities have not publicly
OL,12,Fcommented on the crossings, and the
OL,13,Finterior ministry did not respond to
OL,14,Frequests for comment.
OL,16,FSpain's Interior Ministry said the
OL,17,FMoroccan government was "closely
OL,18,Fcooperating" to handle the situation,
OL,19,Fsaying that Moroccan police are
OL,20,Fstopping "numerous people" trying to
OL,21,Fcross the border.
OL,26,@yD@YOUzD@LO]|D@JOU|D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FBoth countries agreed to work together
OL,7,F"for the return, as soon as possible,
OL,8,Fof all the people who entered Ceuta
OL,9,Fillegally".
OL,11,FFernando Grande-Marlaska, the Spanish
OL,12,FInterior Minister, will travel to
OL,13,FCeuta on Friday to evaluate the
OL,14,Fsituation.
OL,16,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,17,Fposted on X: "The Government of Spain
OL,18,Fis fully committed to providing an
OL,19,Fimmediate response to the situation in
OL,20,FCeuta."
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FHe said his government, in partnership
OL,7,Fwith Morocco, is "preparing the
OL,8,Fnecessary measures to restore normalcy
OL,9,Fas soon as possible".
OL,11,FSpain is a main point of arrival into
OL,12,FEurope for migrants seeking better
OL,13,Feconomic opportunities or an escape
OL,14,Ffrom violence in their home countries.
OL,16,FTo reach Ceuta, located on the
OL,17,Fnorthern African coast, migrants often
OL,18,Fswim from the Moroccan town of
OL,19,FCastillejos, covering about three
OL,20,Fmiles to reach Spanish territory.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FWhile there is no indication of what
OL,7,Fprompted the latest crossings, the
OL,8,Fscenes at the border have drawn
OL,9,Fcomparisons with May 2021, when more
OL,10,Fthan 8,000 migrants entered Ceuta over
OL,11,Ftwo days.
OL,13,FAt the time, Morocco was accused of
OL,14,Feasing border controls after Spain
OL,15,Fallowed Brahim Ghali, leader of the
OL,16,FPolisario Front opposing Moroccan
OL,17,Foccupation of the Western Sahara, to
OL,18,Freceive medical treatment at a Spanish
OL,19,Fhospital ` triggering a diplomatic
OL,20,Fcrisis.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FJuan Jesus Vivas, the head of Ceuta's
OL,12,Fregional government, called for the
OL,13,Fgovernment to declare a national
OL,14,Femergency on grounds of national
OL,15,Fsecurity, asking for more police and
OL,16,Fthe army to be deployed on the border.
OL,18,FVivas said the additional police and
OL,19,Fsoldiers would be necessary "to
OL,20,Fguarantee the inviolability of the
OL,21,Ffrontier and citizen safety."
OL,26,@sD@Irz{D@]OU}D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FHe had warned on Wednesday that
OL,7,Fmigrant reception centres were
OL,8,Foverwhelmed with hundreds of people
OL,9,Fsleeping on the streets after more
OL,10,Fthan 1,500 migrants entered the
OL,11,Fterritory in the past week. But
OL,12,Fthousands more crossed overnight and
OL,13,Fon Thursday.
OL,15,FSpain's Interior Ministry, which
OL,16,Ftracks irregular migration, would not
OL,17,Fconfirm the number of migrants who had
OL,18,Fmade it to Ceuta in the last few days
OL,19,Fbut said it would publish its next
OL,20,Fmigration report on August 3.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FLegislation covering a declaration of
OL,7,Fnational emergencies does not consider
OL,8,Fmigration flows a risk to national
OL,9,Fsecurity, according to the ministry,
OL,10,Fwhich said government administrations
OL,11,Fare "coordinating to respond with
OL,12,Fspeed and efficacy to the situation in
OL,13,FCeuta".
OL,15,FCeuta has been under Spanish rule
OL,16,Fsince 1580.
