OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785494889
OL,3,CThousands of migrants enter Spain's
OL,4,CCeuta enclave from Morocco
OL,6,FIts mixed population of Christians and
OL,7,FMuslims, Spanish and Moroccan
OL,8,Fresidents and day workers, live in
OL,9,Frelative harmony behind a border fence
OL,10,Fthat many migrants from across Africa
OL,11,Fattempt to cross for a better life in
OL,12,FEurope.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
